AFL++ licensing has moved to the repository root.

AFL++ is licensed under the GNU AGPL-3.0-or-later, and it also contains files
under the Apache-2.0 License. Each file states its own license in its
SPDX-License-Identifier header. An optional commercial license is available.

Please see, in the repository root:

  - LICENSING.md          - plain-language overview of the whole scheme
  - LICENSE               - full AGPL-3.0 text (the project's overall license)
  - LICENSE.Apache-2.0    - full Apache-2.0 text (the license of Apache-2.0 files)
  - LICENSE.COMMERCIAL    - the optional, donation-based commercial license

Each source file carries an SPDX-License-Identifier indicating its license.

Questions about licensing: afl@aflplus.plus
